From: Bellatrix Project <bellatrix@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Workbook: keep icon.library call out of line on m68k

GCC 6.5 inlines the small wrapper at -Os, recreating the address-register
pressure that the wrapper avoids.  Keep this library-base call out of line.
---
 workbench/system/Workbook/wbicon.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/workbench/system/Workbook/wbicon.c b/workbench/system/Workbook/wbicon.c
--- a/workbench/system/Workbook/wbicon.c
+++ b/workbench/system/Workbook/wbicon.c
@@ -38,6 +38,7 @@ const struct TagItem wbIcon_DrawTags[] = {
     { TAG_DONE },
 };
 
+__attribute__((noinline))
 static void wbIcon_GetRectangle(struct WorkbookBase *wb, struct wbIcon *my,
     struct Rectangle *rect)
 {
-- 
2.43.0
